OL,3,GNEWSA'My 11-year-old son screams in
OL,4,Apain every day'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn a muddy football pitch in February,
OL,7,F11-year-old Ollie was running down the
OL,8,Fwing with the ball when he was tackled.
OL,10,FHe suffered what was believed to be an
OL,11,Finnocuous injury to his right knee ` he
OL,12,Fwas not in severe pain initially but he
OL,13,Fcould not bend or move it properly.
OL,15,FAfter investigations by doctors, which
OL,16,Fincluded an exploratory arthroscopy -
OL,17,Fkeyhole surgery to check joints ` the
OL,18,Fyoungster from Nantwich, Cheshire,
OL,19,Fdeveloped excruciating, persistent
OL,20,Fpain.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
